name: Explicit atomic review of a bounded relationship selection
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/bulk_relationships.py prepare @TMP_TARGET @ART
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: relationships
require-live-snap: 25 FINDING RELATIONSHIPS | proposals
require-live-snap: 25 3 relationships | loaded-proposals
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 RELATIONSHIPS · PgUp/PgDn details · Esc back | navigation-owner
type: *
require-live-snap: 25 3 selected | selected-page
keys: A
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW 3 RELATIONSHIPS | review-selection
keys: ] Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Owned greeting. Never executed. | recorded-source
expect: Viewing Review
expect: G return
keys: G
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW 3 RELATIONSHIPS | returned-review
expect: Inspecting destination
keys: j
live-snap: second-pair
keys: j
live-snap: third-pair
ask: Does the bulk reader expose exactly three captured relationship revisions and let the operator inspect each pair without implying finding confirmation?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Reason (required) | empty-reason
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Enter a reason | reason-required
paste-file: @ART/accept-note.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM Accept 3 | acceptance-confirmation
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/bulk_relationships.py pending @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does the confirmation show the target, exact revisions, reason, zero model calls and independent finding verdicts before any write?
resize: 40x12
live-snap: narrow-confirmation
keys: PageDown
live-snap: narrow-terms
keys: PageDown
live-snap: narrow-reason
keys: PageDown
live-snap: narrow-captured-selection
ask: At 40x12 are the confirmation terms and reason readable through paging, with the action and cancel owner always clear?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Duplicate · Accepted | accepted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/bulk_relationships.py accepted @TMP_TARGET @ART
type: *
keys: A
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW 3 RELATIONSHIPS | unlink-review
keys: u
paste-file: @ART/unlink-note.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM Unlink 3 | unlink-confirmation
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/bulk_relationships.py stale-write @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Relationship selection changed | stale-refusal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/bulk_relationships.py stale @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does one stale relationship refuse the entire held batch and preserve its reason and captured versions, with no partially unlinked prefix?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Unlink 3 relationships · reason | retained-reason
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW 3 RELATIONSHIPS | retained-review
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 FINDING RELATIONSHIPS | returned-browser
keys: c R
require-live-snap: 25 Duplicate · Rejected | refreshed
type: *
keys: A
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW 3 RELATIONSHIPS | reviewed-refresh
keys: u
paste-file: @ART/unlink-note.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM Unlink 3 | fresh-unlink-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Duplicate · Removed | removed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/bulk_relationships.py removed @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does explicit review of the fresh selection atomically unlink all three while retaining four observations and all independent finding verdicts?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: relationships
require-live-snap: 25 Duplicate · Removed | recovered
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/bulk_relationships.py restarted @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart preserve all reviewed relationships and observations without another model call or automatic finding decision?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
